WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.520
The ruins are in an underground cave 
200 meters directly beneath us.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:07.900
Okay.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.610
Back me up.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.150
I'm going in.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.820
Please be careful!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:24.500
This is it!

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.800
In the Palm of the Hand

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.100
So you did show up,

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:03.850
key boy.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:10.020
<i>I can't use the void?</i>

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.320
Cal, I heard about you from BB.

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.030
Is the princess already inside this?

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.910
It's impossible to physically 
destroy the ruins.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.870
But I can obstruct them.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.660
My tattoo originally came from here.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.670
If I can make a path to it, I can interfere.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.420
You think you can do that with me here?

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.760
BB destroyed my absolute 
boundary's control circuits,

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:41.340
but that made it possible for 
me to use the noise canceler.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:46.270
And to make up for the loss of my ability, 
I honed my spirit, technique, and body.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.100
I don't mean to brag,

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.730
but I'm sure BB would still call me...

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.980
the "strongest of the powerless."

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.950
Last time, BB and I beat you together.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.990
And now, BB is right here.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.950
I don't mean to brag, either,

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.250
but if I beat you, don't fall for me, okay?

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.120
I'm just a kid.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.340
I don't have any time to waste.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:18.630
She's right within arm's reach!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:22.050
I didn't expect Cal to 
use the noise canceler.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.760
If his restorative ability isn't sealed,

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:30.020
Seigi-kun's chances aren't zero... But...

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.070
<i>Super-acceleration using 
distortions in space...</i>

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.950
<i>A double-edged charge that ignores</i>

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.820
<i>any damage his body takes...</i>

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.080
Tamaki Souha, the Ox Demon...

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.040
is coming.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:59.510
I'm going to rush you hard and deep, 
as many times as it takes!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.180
You are incredible, on so many levels!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.650
Two against one definitely puts 
me at a disadvantage.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.940
Question!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.650
According to Freud, what do

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.660
snakes symbolize in a dream?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.120
Male genitalia.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.120
Why would you answer that, Il?!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.500
Izzy-chan...

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:35.580
Quit being snooty and suck on this!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.670
This is a snake den!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.380
I've got my pick of the goods!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.520
<i>This might be a problem...</i>

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.610
Lawrence! Tony!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.780
Izzy? So it really is you.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:12.040
Lisa? Why are you fighting each other?

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.870
We'll talk later!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.920
I'll handle Lisa.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.000
You guys take care of that 
fucking head over there.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.260
Izzy's language has gotten pretty nasty.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:23.970
This is pretty serious.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.470
If that's how you're playing, 
this game is mine!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:29.970
Hey, now, that's just cowardly!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.470
Like you can talk!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.060
May the Force be with you!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.860
Don't get cocky, pigs!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:53.620
If you think I won't go all-out 
against Lisa, you're dead wrong!

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.760
Better grit your teeth,

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.720
you homewrecker!

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.440
Oh, crap...

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:29.030
Do you know how anacondas mate?

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:33.580
A bunch of males surround 
one female and intertwine,

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.040
forming a big ball of snakes.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.330
I... got careless...

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.210
You can be the first to die!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.050
Lawrence!

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:47.920
And now you!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.110
Wh-What...

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.240
It's a special bullet 
just for Sealed like you.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.830
Inside it is the venom of 
the snakes you love so much.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.000
I don't really like snakes, you know.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.920
And I really don't want 
to see a ball of snakes.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.730
This is great... Just fantastic!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:48.110
I guess you've got a few screws loose, huh?

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.740
But that's what I like!

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.030
Come on, charge straight into me!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.950
I'm all ready!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:00.500
But you have to die on 
the bed of spikes, too!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.250
I've made a promise to return home alive.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.630
I'm a pro-level protagonist.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.670
And as you know,

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.720
protagonists are people who transcend reason.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:18.470
You're best off assuming that I'm not human.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.350
You are seriously crazy!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.100
Come on, die with me!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.060
I wholeheartedly refuse!

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:28.070
You insufferable cock!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:50.960
Namu...

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:56.510
<i>She's pretty damn strong, all right...</i>

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.020
<i>He's going for my chest?</i>

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:12.690
<i>Right here!</i>

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.550
Hey, Cal,

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.050
there's something I want to ask you.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.140
How can a measly human support a stupid idea

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.100
like trying to become a god?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.060
It makes no damn sense.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:47.230
An egoist such as yourself 
wouldn't understand.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.400
I'll tell you, as an offering before you die.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:55.990
As you know, the princess is what
she is because of her sisters.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:01.030
When she uses the four keys to 
fully activate all four ruins,

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:04.540
the link between the princess, 
who is their yorishiro,

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.710
and her sisters will also be complete.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.670
It will mean the fusion of their minds, 
and their homogenization.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:12.630
Yes,

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:16.630
the personality we identify as 
Princess Aryabhata will be lost.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:22.560
The unified spiritual body will 
perpetually rewrite itself.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:27.060
It will then be freed from the 
limits of the human species,

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.480
its pattern of thought will transform,

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.060
and it will be reborn 
as a far superior being.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.610
"Becoming a god" is a sort of allegory.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.950
It means the princess's wishes will 
create a god in a world that lacks one.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:44.740
If one truly wishes to be omnipotent,

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.000
the "human" framework is only a hindrance.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:51.750
She's... not going to be herself anymore?

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:56.010
To deny other humans, but never herself...

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.010
Did you truly think the princess 
was that sort of person?

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:14.190
Arya, why don't you understand?

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:18.780
All I want is for you to be you...

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.120
Her, deny herself?

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:31.830
As if I'm going to allow that.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.960
That's my job!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.170
I have to avenge Touko with my own hands,

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.210
or there's no point!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.890
You shouldn't rely on 
weapons you aren't used to.

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:52.520
And you shouldn't rely on 
tools you aren't used to!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.030
You are correct.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.660
<i>Cal intends to finish this 
with her next attack.</i>

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.920
That's fine.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.460
She can't finish me off 
with that piece of crap.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:19.710
The best gift you can give to the dead

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:21.920
is not grief, but gratitude.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:25.140
For bringing the key all the way here,

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.510
I thank you with all my heart.

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.020
We've gotta hurry to Seigi!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:36.650
Right.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:38.400
<i>Seigi...</i>

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.240
<i>If I take the slightest step 
within her blade's range,</i>

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.410
<i>she'll strike out from her low stance.</i>

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:59.710
This is distracting, so I will close my eyes.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.960
Now, come.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:04.680
Thanks for your concern.

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:12.140
<i>Time to go...</i>

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.980
<i>to the place BB couldn't reach on his own.</i>

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.150
You are strong.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:19.900
Stronger than me, and stronger than Cal.

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:20.610
So...

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:37.750
Don't stand still!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.760
You are already dead!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.770
Why...

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.520
are you always so far from me?

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:01.900
Yes...

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:05.780
That's why your sword will 
never reach me again.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.740
Did you see that, BB?

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.830
I beat Cal.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.350
Damn... Was I too late?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.470
I never expected you to defeat Cal.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.480
Seigi, here.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.690
You keep this.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:49.740
A memento of Touko-chan.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:54.620
I'm sorry. I know an apology 
won't fix anything now,

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.330
but no matter how much you blame me, I...

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.750
It's fine. It wasn't your fault.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:00.080
But...

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.130
Touko's killer was the Kingdom.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.500
That cat, the princess...

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.090
And Touko died

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.590
because I wasn't strong enough.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.480
I hate, hate, hate...

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:20.940
no one more...

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.730
<i>...than myself.</i>

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.110
I'll just take the two keys

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.570
you've kept for me.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.370
<i>I don't care if it costs my life.</i>

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.620
You can have my blood, my flesh, my bones...

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.040
even my soul.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.580
So...

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.540
Let me kill you!

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.210
Very well.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.470
I'll play with you a bit.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.050
At last, it's starting...

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.850
I like where this is going.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.440
This will somewhat curb the exhaustion of

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.150
your soul due to overuse of your power.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:04.650
Thanks.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.580
Are those really going to help you?

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.500
Wings that can't fly are just decoration.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:26.080
I'll send you to the next world with this!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.550
What's wrong with a little decoration?

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.470
These symbolize my majesty.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:34.840
Even without wings, I can still fly.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:38.350
Don't you get funny with me!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.080
Why?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.250
Why can't I use that power?

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.500
Why can't I defeat that power?!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.170
Really, what a laugh.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:13.090
Maybe you could have back then,

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.590
but now that you have been

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.590
taken captive by hatred and lost your way,

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.350
you cannot use this power.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:29.730
Yes, you have let go of whatever

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.980
slight chance of victory you had.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.030
What?

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:42.490
The hole...

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:44.710
My signal is...

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.330
Hey! We've got trouble!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.090
Very, very big trouble!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.510
One who is truly strong

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:56.590
can control the environment 
and psychology of the weak,

00:17:56.880 --> 00:18:00.100
making the weak serve them 
without realizing it.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.100
The weak are eaten away 
by illogical feelings,

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.060
unaware of their ignorance,

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:08.520
and unwittingly become absorbed 
in their servitude, like slaves.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.860
Bitterly, pathetically, miserably...

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.900
Yes, all this time,

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.860
you've been dancing in the palm of my hand.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.740
All I need to do now is...

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.580
close my hand.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.090
This is bad... This is bad!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:34.500
Tom!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.970
Lieutenant! Tamaki-san!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.090
Where's Seigi-kun?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:42.430
He's down there fighting the princess now,

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:45.020
but the hole leading straight 
to the ruins closed up!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.170
<i>I am sorry...</i>

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.840
<i>Princess, it looks like my time is up.</i>

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:23.010
<i>Bring the blessing of death to mankind!</i>

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.310
<i>Bring a new order to the world!</i>

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.140
No way!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.760
We're saved...

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.470
It self-destructed?

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:05.050
It seems so.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:09.520
For better or for worse, 
it looks like the path is laid.

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.230
Let's go and meet Seigi-kun.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:13.270
Yeah.

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:17.190
Colonel...

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:18.650
Dad!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:22.400
Th-That voice... It must be Izzy.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.360
I swear...

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.620
Where did you run off to at a time like this?

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:31.250
I-I'm sorry...

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:36.880
Well, it's not the first time 
you've acted on your own.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:41.010
I know what I must look like 
now, but listen to me, Izzy.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.550
You must stop the princess.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.220
I'll be all right. Just get going.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:49.600
I know.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:53.600
There's something I have to do there, too.

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:00.530
You've gotten stronger.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:04.450
Straight to the place we've been avoiding...

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:10.200
I'm so sorry I was such a useless 
dad right up to the end.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.330
But I have a duty to protect this country.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:16.880
I won't die a clown.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:20.750
If worst comes to worst, 
I've got a nuclear bomb.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:25.050
<i>So I really ended up coming back here...</i>

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:28.760
<i>To that horrible place where I lost</i>

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:30.890
<i>my parents and my brother.</i>

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.560
<i>If I had reported to the colonel then,</i>

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:37.100
<i>I probably wouldn't have come back here.</i>

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:41.190
<i>If I hadn't sheltered him in a 
temporary lapse of judgment...</i>

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>Was it you who led me</i>

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.530
<i>to meet Seigi?</i>

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.450
<i>I'll sever those ties here.</i>

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.740
<i>This time, I'll protect him.</i>

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.540
<i>I won't let Seigi die!</i>

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:38.270
Seigi...

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:42.150
No!

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:45.360
I have to be the one to defeat her!

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:47.940
I have to avenge Touko!

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:50.150
I don't want to lose anyone.

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:54.950
Let me give my own life to save Izzy!

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:54.990
The Deciding Battle
